@startuml pipeline-flow
' CodeTrace — delivery pipeline flow
' Render: https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml  |  java -jar plantuml.jar pipeline-flow.puml

title CodeTrace — one PRD to a converged codebase

skinparam backgroundColor #F5F6F8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #2A4BD7
skinparam ArrowFontColor #5B6473
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #CDD2DA
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  FontColor #171B23
  roundCorner 12
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #CDD2DA
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  FontColor #171B23
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #CDD2DA
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF3
  FontColor #3a424f
}

rectangle "**docs/PRD.md**\nsingle source of truth" as PRD #EEF1FB

rectangle "**0 · Intent**\n/pipeline-init\nnormalize-prd + prd-analyst-agent" as S0
rectangle "**1 · Architecture**\n/generate-sa\ngenerate-sa + architect-agent" as S1
rectangle "**2 · Build spec**\n/generate-spec\ngenerate-build-spec + spec-builder-agent" as S2
rectangle "**3 · Task slices**\n/slice-work\nslice-build-tasks + spec-builder-agent" as S3
rectangle "**4 · Coding**\n/implement\nimplement-from-task + coding-agent" as S4
rectangle "**5 · Verify**\n/verify\nverify-build + qa-acceptance-agent" as S5
rectangle "**6 · Accept**\n/accept\naccept-milestone + qa-acceptance-agent" as S6
rectangle "**7 · Converge** (loop)\n/converge\naudit-quality + audit-agent" as S7 #EEF1FB

database "**.claude/memory/**\npipeline-state · frozen-decisions\nopen-questions · implementation-log\nconvergence-state" as MEM
rectangle "**.claude/rules/**\n10 non-negotiable constraints\n(freeze upstream · branch · commit\n· maps-not-warehouses · summary-sync)" as RULES #FFFDF3

PRD --> S0
S0 --> S1 : intent/brief.md
S1 --> S2 : architecture/SA.md\n**(frozen)**
S2 --> S3 : build/*
S3 --> S4 : build/tasks.md
S4 --> S5 : src/ + tests/
S5 --> S6 : verification evidence
S6 --> S7 : accepted milestone
S7 --> S7 : audit → score → stop-check\n→ re-plan → implement → verify

MEM .up.> S4 : resumable state\n(read before, write after\n**every** stage)
RULES .up.> S2 : constrain\n**every** stage

note right of S7
  **Machine-checkable gates**
  tests · coverage · mutation
  lint · types · complexity
  --
  A regression guard reverts any round
  that worsens a gate. Stop conditions
  (converged / plateau / budget)
  guarantee termination.
end note

note bottom of PRD
  Every downstream artifact derives
  from upstream ones. Architecture is
  frozen before build specs; build specs
  before code.
end note

@enduml
